 Multiple exclusion blocks can be used in the same document.
 
+### Per-page settings
+
+Settings that apply to a single page go under the front-matter key `md2conf`:
+
+```yaml
+---
+title: "Example document"
+md2conf:
+  code_line_numbers: true
+---
+```
+
+* `code_line_numbers`: show (`true`) or hide (`false`) line numbers in the code blocks of this page, regardless of `--code-line-numbers`.
+
 ### Labels
 
 If a Markdown document has the front-matter attribute `tags`, *md2conf* assigns the specified tags to the Confluence page as labels.
